WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:17.105
"Poppy," said Eddy.

2
00:00:17.106 --> 00:00:26.059
"You have a flat tire."

3
00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:34.634
"I don't care," said Poppy.

4
00:00:34.635 --> 00:00:45.270
Thump, thump, thump!

5
00:00:45.271 --> 00:00:49.569
"Come here, Poppy!" called Ms. Fender.

6
00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:55.476
"You need a new tire!"

7
00:00:55.477 --> 00:00:58.678
"I'm okay," said Poppy.

8
00:00:58.679 --> 00:01:02.561
"I want to keep playing tag!"

9
00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:04.983
Thump, thump, thump!

10
00:01:04.984 --> 00:01:09.521
Poppy chased her friends.

11
00:01:09.522 --> 00:01:17.421
But she was slow now.

12
00:01:17.422 --> 00:01:21.129
"Listen to Ms. Fender," said Eddy.

13
00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:23.723
"You need a new tire."

14
00:01:23.724 --> 00:01:26.929
"Nah," said Poppy.

15
00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:29.517
"I'm fine."

16
00:01:29.518 --> 00:01:31.947
Poppy drove forward.

17
00:01:31.948 --> 00:01:34.444
She drove backward.

18
00:01:34.445 --> 00:01:36.880
Thump, thump, thump.

19
00:01:36.881 --> 00:01:39.408
"See?" said Poppy.

20
00:01:39.409 --> 00:01:42.302
"I can still drive.

21
00:01:42.303 --> 00:01:46.465
Let's keep playing tag!"

22
00:01:46.466 --> 00:01:51.062
Poppy chased her friends.

23
00:01:51.063 --> 00:01:54.057
Ms. Fender frowned.

24
00:01:54.058 --> 00:01:57.096
Poppy tried to tag Eddy.

25
00:01:57.097 --> 00:01:59.549
But Eddy drove away.

26
00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:03.011
Then . . .

27
00:02:03.012 --> 00:02:06.215
"Uh-oh, Poppy!" said Dipper.

28
00:02:06.216 --> 00:02:09.914
"I see smoke!"
